# Grounds Command entry points. The back office is a separate Cloudflare Worker
# deployment (it needs D1, R2, and server rendering), so these hand off to it
# rather than serving from this static site.
#
# 302 not 301: the target may move, and a cached permanent redirect would be
# very hard to walk back from visitors' browsers.
/admin-command   https://command.argrounds.com/admin-command   302
/admincommand    https://command.argrounds.com/admin-command   302
